stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AVAILABLE : Stock Loaded (Qty = 100)

    AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : Atomic Lua Decrement\n(10-Min TTL Started)
    
    state RESERVED {
        [*] --> PendingPayment
        PendingPayment --> PAYMENT_PENDING : User Initiates Checkout
    }

    PAYMENT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Payment Gateway Success
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED : Payment Gateway Declined
    
    RESERVED --> TIMEOUT : 600s Pass Without Payment
    
    PAYMENT_FAILED --> RELEASED : Compensation Lua INCR (+1 Stock)
    TIMEOUT --> RELEASED : Delay Queue Sweeper Lua INCR (+1 Stock)

    RELEASED --> AVAILABLE : Stock Restored to Pool

    CONFIRMED --> SOLD : Order Service Creates Order & Ships

    SOLD --> [*]
